{"segs": ["PA_ja_86:0.2", "PA_ja_86:0.3"], "en": "The First Book, Chapter on the Non-Drinker (Apāyimha-vagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_86:0.4"], "en": "6. The Sīlavīmaṁsaka Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_86:1.1"], "en": "“Virtue alone, it is said, is beautiful;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_86:1.2"], "en": "virtue is unsurpassed in the world.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_86:1.3"], "en": "\"Behold, though he be a serpent of deadly venom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_86:1.4"], "en": "because he is virtuous, he is not slain.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_86:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the sixth Jātaka, the Sīlavīmaṁsaka-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
